    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cozy visuals, a relaxing and engaging gameplay loop, and cute robots, <br><br>Starflower Inc. offers a delightful spin on farming simulation. Perfect your strategy, automate and optimize your workflow!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cozy, relaxing gameplay that's easy to pick up but satisfyingly deep.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute and customizable robotic farmhands ready for your commands.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plant, harvest, and expand your farm!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cozy visuals, a relaxing and engaging gameplay loop, and cute robots, <br><br>Starflower Inc. offers a delightful spin on farming simulation. Perfect your strategy, automate and optimize your workflow!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cozy, relaxing gameplay that's easy to pick up but satisfyingly deep.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute and customizable robotic farmhands ready for your commands.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plant, harvest, and expand your farm!</p></li></ul>",
